 2280: //    For a point (x1,y1) inside the element and a line segment (x1,y1)-(x2,y2), find the intersection point 
 2281: //    (xIntersect,yIntersect) and the side (intersectingSide) that it intersects.
 2282: 
 2283: //    Inputs:
 2284: //    @param x1, y1: point inside the element
 2285: //    @param x2, y2: other end of the line segment
 2286: 
 2287: //    Outputs:
